SUMMARY:AIIII AI Hackathon
DESCRIPTION:AIIII AI Hackathon\, Prague | December 12\, 2026\n\nVenue: Revitalised former railway station building (Bubeneč)\, capacity 250. Full day\, single-track hackathon programme (09:00–21:00) for up to 170 guests. Keynote by Martin Fikejz (CTU)\, workshops by Barbora Poláková and Lucie Svobodová\, all-day catering\, team hacking\, and interactive energizer activities. Registration via Google Forms\; badges at arrival. Digital\, GDPR-compliant event. Schedule includes networking\, coding\, lunch\, workshops\, demos\, awards\, chill zone\, trivia\, and more. Contact: info@aiiii-hackathon.com. Website: www.aiiii-hackathon.com
LOCATION:Revitalised former railway station building (Bubeneč)\, Prague\, Czech Republic
